From 965df89a841e5f619f4d838adec9175c6059ead8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Atkins <mart@degeneration.co.uk>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 11:11:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] go.mod: go get google.golang.org/grpc@v1.83.0

This is our routine upgrade to latest in preparation for the v1.13 series,
but being performed a little earlier in the development period than usual
in order to clear the false-positive security advisory in
opentofu/opentofu#4435.

Signed-off-by: Martin Atkins <mart@degeneration.co.uk>
